      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Limb pain in children is one of the most frequent reasons to refer to the emergency unit. Most often it suggests an orthopaedic, a muscular, a peripheral neurologic or a spinal affection. We report two cases of recurrent limb pains revealing a central nervous system tumor."},
